      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. some of those sound a bit like they're just trying to dodge the responsibility though. like the \"too complex\" one sounds like a way to avoid the actual issue. do people who support reparations usually see those arguments as legitimate points or do they mostly just view them as excuses to maintain the status quo?",
